# Trace dashboard frontend

Vite 6 + React 18 + TanStack Query v5 + Tailwind 3 + Recharts + `@xyflow/react`. **No react-router** — tabs are `useState<TabId>` in `App.tsx`.

- `vite.config.ts`: `base: "./"` so one build works at `/` and `/dashboard/`. Dev port **5173**, proxy `/api` → `127.0.0.1:8765`.
- Hosted detection: `shared/api.ts` `MOUNT_PREFIX = "/dashboard"`, `isHosted`. Launch tab: `Launch` locally, `LaunchUnavailable` when hosted.
- Data: `hooks/useCasePolling.ts` (2s refetch). Types in `shared/types.ts`. Theme: `pink` | `biz` via `shared/theme.tsx`.
- Token key in this SPA is `maads_access_token`. Webapp uses `maads.accessToken` — **they do not match**. Hosted auth relies on HttpOnly `maads_session` cookie; do not “fix” keys without updating both sides and tests.
- No eslint/prettier. Typecheck with `npm run build` (`tsc && vite build`).

```tsx
// ✅ GOOD
{tab === "launch" ? (isHosted ? <LaunchUnavailable /> : <Launch />) : null}

// ❌ BAD — do not add react-router to this SPA
<BrowserRouter><Routes/></BrowserRouter>
```
